        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: पालन करणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पालन करणे — pālan karṇe — \"to comply with; to observe\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सगळ्यांनी वाहतुकीच्या नियमांचं पालन केलं पाहिजे. sagaḷyānnī vāhtukīcyā niymāñcaṁ pālan kelaṁ pāhije. Everyone must observe the traffic rules."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने पालन केलं, tyāne pālan kelaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The rule takes -चं: नियमांचं पालन करणे (pālan karṇe); also to bring up: मुलांचं पालन."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पालन करणे (pālan karṇe) joins the tatsama पालन, Sanskrit pālana, \"protecting, keeping\" (CDIAL 8128), to करणे, \"to do\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
